UUID: df4f5139-d70d-35e6-bef7-5840d044606b
This data set describes the production of a circulation pump including energy use, use of semi-finished products and working materials, waste treatment and transports of components.
Location: This data represent the production in Europa.
Technology: 5 kg circulation pump
Time period: Literature source uses data from 1996.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: no extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_df4f5139-d70d-35e6-bef7-5840d044606b.xml</text>
